Description: Automated multi-site speed test runner
 Automates major speed test sites (Cloudflare, Netflix/fast.com,
 Google Fiber, Ookla, M-Lab, USEN, iNonius) with Selenium WebDriver
 for continuous network quality monitoring.
 Results can be sent to Zabbix, Grafana Cloud, or OpenTelemetry backends.
